The shaded region consists of 16 congruent squares. If $PQ = 6$ cm, what is the area of the entire shaded region?

[asy]
for(int i = 0; i < 5; ++i)
{

for(int j = 0; j < 2; ++j)

{

filldraw((i,j)--(i+1,j)--(i+1,j+1)--(i,j+1)--(i,j)--cycle,gray,linewidth(2));

}
}

for(int i = 0; i < 2; ++i)
{

for(int j = 0; j < 5; ++j)

{

filldraw((i,j)--(i+1,j)--(i+1,j+1)--(i,j+1)--(i,j)--cycle,gray,linewidth(2));

